<title>AUSTRIA: ALGERIA AMBASSADOR SET TO LEAD OPEC DELEGATION.</title>
<headline>ALGERIA AMBASSADOR SET TO LEAD OPEC DELEGATION.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's delegation to the Vienna OPEC meeting which begins on Wednesday is expected to be led by its ambassador to Austria, Halim Ben Atallah, according to an OPEC official.</p>
<p>The official said he understood that Algeria was still completing the formation of a new government following elections on June 5</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
